  "title": "Zesty Winey Norwegian Lamb Stir-fry",
  "description": "A hearty and flavorful Norwegian dish featuring lamb, dark brown sugar, and a hint of wine, perfect for a date night dinner. This stir-fry is nut-free and easy to make.",
